This simple Python calculator game is a great way for beginners to practice programming basics and have fun experimenting with code. Feel free to modify it and add new features!__

I created a small password guessing game in Python where the player has to guess the correct password to win.
Here is the Python code for the password game:
SECRET_PASSWORD = "python123"  # you can change this password
def main():
for attempt in range(1, MAX_ATTEMPTS + 1):
    guess = input(f"Attempt {attempt}: Enter your password: ")

    if guess == SECRET_PASSWORD:
        print(" Access Granted! You guessed the password correctly.")
        break
    else:
        print(" Wrong password.")

    if attempt == MAX_ATTEMPTS:
        print("\nGame Over! You have used all attempts.")

